From a20ccda228c7cf1bbe31fdcc005aba3e0e639b1c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SovereignOS Build <build@sovereignos.local>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 02:30:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sovereignos: quiesce the real user during a decoy session and
 add the return path

Squash of former patches:

- 0008 sovereignos: add RealUserQuiescer for duress decoy freeze/unfreeze
- 0009 sovereignos: expose quiesceUserApps/unquiesceUserApps via ActivityManagerInternal
- 0010 sovereignos: suppress notifications for a duress-quiesced user
- 0011 sovereignos: unquiesce a user automatically when it becomes current
- 0012 sovereignos: quiesce the real user after switching, not before
- 0013 sovereignos: add verifyPrimaryCredentialNoRouting for the duress return path
- 0014 sovereignos: zeroize the synthetic password in verifyPrimaryCredentialNoRouting
- 0015 sovereignos: add ReturnToRealUserHelper, wire the return path
- 0016 sovereignos: suppress call and media notifications for a duress-quiesced user
